Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.70,0:00:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, class! Find a partner and hold hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.50,0:00:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Friends Work Together!"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.50,0:00:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, class! Find a partner and hold hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, class! Find a partner and hold hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.41,0:00:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna be my partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.12,0:00:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.95,0:00:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone have their partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.12,0:00:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.29,0:00:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's your partner, Miyamura-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.37,0:00:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Who wants to be Miyamura-kun's partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.16,0:00:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.16,0:00:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Eww, no! He's weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.04,0:00:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Science Lab"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.25,0:00:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be doing an experiment today,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.37,0:00:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,so get into groups of five.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.91,0:00:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,--Can I join you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.87,0:00:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,--Hey, thanks.\N--Can I join you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.00,0:00:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura's left over again... He's so gloomy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.87,0:00:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He's totally impossible to read.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.79,0:00:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, someone take Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.79,0:00:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.70,0:01:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,"Ugh"... yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.54,0:01:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.12,0:01:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,School is hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.12,0:01:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, it's kind of impressive\Nhow gloomy he is all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.20,0:01:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.75,0:01:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura, duh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.04,0:01:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura? Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.70,0:01:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, who?\NWhere have you been, Hori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.87,0:01:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,For the next classics report,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.91,0:01:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,we have to group up with the\Nperson next to us on the roster.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.83,0:01:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What're you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.70,0:01:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,N-Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.41,0:01:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You just hid something, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.25,0:01:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently we're gonna be\Ngrouped up on the next report.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.54,0:02:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. O-Okay, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.00,0:02:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,My name's Hori.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.37,0:02:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You should at least know the\Nnames of the people in your class.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.54,0:02:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.20,0:02:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't she just say she\Ndidn't know who I was, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.29,0:02:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone says you're all dark and gloomy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.62,0:02:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.62,0:02:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I talked to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.45,0:02:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But wow,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.75,0:02:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,you're totally normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.33,0:02:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san's kind of weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.58,0:02:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Horimiya"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.16,0:04:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.54,0:04:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"That's Why It's Okay"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.54,0:04:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.33,0:04:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"That's Why It's Okay"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.33,0:04:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.79,0:04:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"That's Why It's Okay"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.79,0:04:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I found my name! I'm in Class 1 with you, Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.54,0:04:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I found my name! I'm in Class 1 with you, Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.08,0:04:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.16,0:04:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Class 1, Class 1, c'mon, Class 1...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.70,0:04:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What class're you in, Ishikawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.00,0:04:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm in Class 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.62,0:04:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes{\i0}! I'm in Class 1, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.83,0:04:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura, I'm in your class!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.33,0:04:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that awesome?! It's the power of love!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.33,0:04:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait... love?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.00,0:04:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, love? Because they're in the same class?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.87,0:04:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Are those two dating?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.87,0:04:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! We'll be together till graduation!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.45,0:04:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What class are you in, Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.91,0:04:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.04,0:04:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, why are you tearing up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.75,0:04:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They're whispering about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.16,0:04:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, man up about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.25,0:04:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock it off, Yoshikawa.\NYou're gonna break his spine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.62,0:04:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Aww.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.58,0:04:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ishikawa, you know how\Nyou gave me that song I wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.66,0:04:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I totally deleted it by accident yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.87,0:05:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, c'mon, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.33,0:05:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,--Yeah, my storage was full,\Nso I went to delete stuff and poof.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.62,0:05:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,--Sometimes, I wonder.\N--Yeah, my storage was full,\Nso I went to delete stuff and poof.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.00,0:05:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,--Sometimes, I wonder.\N--I thought you bought\Nthe one with the most space.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.29,0:05:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,--I did! That's why I thought I'd be safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.37,0:05:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,--I'm in this group...\N--I did! That's why I thought I'd be safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.29,0:05:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,--I'm in this group...\N--Man, their new album is so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.83,0:05:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,--but am I really a part of it?\N--Man, their new album is so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.20,0:05:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,--but am I really a part of it?\N--I have to wait till my older sister\Nfinishes with the CD first though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.95,0:05:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I want the new album, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.08,0:05:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"All About Chemical Reactions"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.41,0:05:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"All About Chemical Reactions"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.41,0:05:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay! Go ahead and split up into\Ngroups of four to work on your reports.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.58,0:05:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay! Go ahead and split up into\Ngroups of four to work on your reports.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.41,0:05:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura, are you all by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.12,0:05:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshikawa, gimme a pen!\NYou've got a million, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.83,0:05:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have a {\i1}million{\i0}!\NPen bullies like you don't {\i1}get {\i0}a pen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.70,0:05:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.58,0:05:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone have the packet?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.79,0:05:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.62,0:05:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"All About Chemical Reactions"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.91,0:05:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmkay, Hori'll turn our outline into a draft.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.37,0:05:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we have enough paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.00,0:05:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.79,0:05:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura, you handle the chart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.70,0:05:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.62,0:06:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Kyoko Hori"\N"Yuki Yoshikawa"\N"Izumi Miyamura"\N"Toru Ishikawa"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.87,0:06:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori! Toru won't give me my pen back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.25,0:06:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm still using it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.79,0:06:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock it off, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.08,0:06:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.12,0:06:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we friends, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.87,0:06:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they cool with me being their friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.08,0:06:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are, Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.25,0:06:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishikawa-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.87,0:06:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard our next class got\Nswitched from Math to Econ.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.91,0:06:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot, did I bring that textbook today?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.45,0:06:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Really wish they wouldn't\Nswitch things up on a dime.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.41,0:06:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, man...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.08,0:07:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.54,0:07:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.79,0:07:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! I thought you were listening to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.91,0:07:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, hey, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.75,0:07:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishikawa-kun, what... do you think of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.25,0:07:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't ask people that with\Na straight face. It's creepy as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.20,0:07:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Creepy"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.20,0:07:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't ask people that with\Na straight face. It's creepy as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.45,0:07:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Creepy"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.45,0:07:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm super annoyed about you\Ngetting along so well with Hori.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.33,0:07:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Annoying"\N"Creepy"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.33,0:07:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm super annoyed about you\Ngetting along so well with Hori.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.79,0:07:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Annoying"\N"Creepy"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.79,0:07:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And you never say what you mean.\NThat's so frustrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.75,0:07:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Annoying"\N"Frustrating" "Creepy"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.75,0:07:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And you never say what you mean.\NThat's so frustrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.08,0:07:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Annoying"\N"Frustrating" "Creepy"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.08,0:07:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You act weird sometimes, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.58,0:07:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You act weird sometimes, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.91,0:07:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're way too nice to people.\NI always have to keep an eye on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.41,0:07:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And when you take off your glasses and put\Nyour hair up, you're prettier than most girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.66,0:07:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's annoying as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.54,0:07:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm pretty...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.83,0:07:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate that, too! How you get\Nme to say the dumbest shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.20,0:07:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You drive me frickin' crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.79,0:07:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,How is that {\i1}my {\i0}fault?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.83,0:08:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're also the only person\Nwho calls me by my last name,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.75,0:08:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,so I kinda wonder what you think of me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.83,0:08:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,T-Toru.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.29,0:08:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.37,0:08:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say it if you're just gonna\Nget all embarrassed, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.04,0:08:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I just said it out loud, jeez! I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.37,0:08:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I... yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.66,0:08:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, that's\Nthe first time ever in high school
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.20,0:08:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,that I've called a classmate\Nby their first name.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.00,0:08:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.87,0:08:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kind of weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.79,0:08:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura, you're weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.33,0:08:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,--Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.95,0:08:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,--You're weird...\N--Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.83,0:09:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,...but that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.00,0:09:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just kind of awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.20,0:09:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You got that, Izumi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.70,0:09:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.91,0:09:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could go back\Nten years and tell myself that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.37,0:09:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori, listen, you gotta avoid flicking the bone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.54,0:09:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you we were gonna\Nfinish our report over lunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.58,0:09:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the heck did you wander off to?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.54,0:09:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The roof, to affirm our friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.45,0:09:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You're creeping me out, you two idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.45,0:09:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yoshikawa's here,\Nso there are {\i1}three {\i0}idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.20,0:09:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! What did you just call me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.12,0:10:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ishikawa-kun. Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.16,0:10:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So I watched that show you\Nsaid you liked, Ishikawa-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.87,0:10:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Izu-- Miyamura, what\Npart did you like the most?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.29,0:10:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.12,0:10:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I thought we were\Non a first-name basis now...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.70,0:10:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's a total mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.87,0:10:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishikawa-kun? Are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.00,0:10:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Hori"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.25,0:10:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, sis, you done yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.75,0:10:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're heading to school already?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.45,0:10:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Yuna-chan's waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.62,0:10:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This early?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.95,0:10:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sota's been getting up way\Nearlier now that he's in grade school...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.00,0:10:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, nobody's even here yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.70,0:10:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I sit here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.25,0:10:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayasaki-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.12,0:11:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I totally thought we had a\Nmorning assembly today. Whoops!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.29,0:11:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, same.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.87,0:11:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So Miyamura-kun's pretty hot, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.25,0:11:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.45,0:11:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you his girlfriend, Hori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.08,0:11:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.79,0:11:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.58,0:11:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I have him, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.08,0:11:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait... {\i1}have {\i0}him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.58,0:11:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you're not dating, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.87,0:11:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So you wouldn't care\Nif him and I got close, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.87,0:11:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.41,0:11:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Miyamura-kun's all mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.20,0:11:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.50,0:11:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't have him. I'm not giving him to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.83,0:12:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? But you said you're just friends, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.54,0:12:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not giving you Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.91,0:12:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.29,0:12:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you're not!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.20,0:12:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But Miyamura-kun's {\i1}not {\i0}your boyfriend!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.95,0:12:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't belong to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.29,0:12:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.29,0:12:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura's {\i1}mine{\i0}! You can't have him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.70,0:12:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Not ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.95,0:12:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never let you have him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.70,0:12:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonder if the cafeteria's open yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.16,0:12:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Okay, bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.04,0:12:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so stupid. Miyamura\Ndoesn't {\i1}belong {\i0}to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.37,0:13:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I shouldn't be\Nsurprised, but seriously...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.33,0:13:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sota needs to stop changing in here\Nbefore he goes out to play!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.16,0:13:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? He's not here again today?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.87,0:13:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He probably came home,\Nthen went right out to play soccer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.54,0:13:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What an energetic little rascal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.04,0:13:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do blueberries, right, Hori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.37,0:13:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since Sota started grade school,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.41,0:13:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,we've been spending a lot\Nmore time alone together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.25,0:13:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That fruit tart you brought over\Nthe other day was really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.16,0:13:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, really? I actually made that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.12,0:13:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, cool! That's neat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.41,0:13:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes, our conversations peter out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.45,0:13:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That looked totally real!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.83,0:14:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, it's just CG. Special effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.58,0:14:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just saying that because\Nyou're scared, right? Right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.70,0:14:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's just the only way it\Ncould pop out at them like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.95,0:14:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Miyamura. It's just my phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.58,0:14:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my mom's gonna be late again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.50,0:14:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.00,0:14:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A blackout?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.62,0:14:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,H-H-Hori-san! Where's your breaker box?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.66,0:14:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be back in a second. Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.37,0:14:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.50,0:14:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,See? It's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.95,0:14:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This house is definitely cursed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.20,0:14:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What're you looking so scared for?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.20,0:14:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's move on to disc two!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.87,0:14:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Disc two?! There are {\i1}more{\i0}\Nin this horror collection?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.16,0:14:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"IT COULD HAPPEN TO YOU:\NReal Horror Stories #49"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.16,0:14:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Disc two?! There are {\i1}more{\i0}\Nin this horror collection?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.62,0:14:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"IT COULD HAPPEN TO YOU:\NReal Horror Stories #49"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.62,0:14:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,How many discs are there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.87,0:14:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"IT COULD HAPPEN TO YOU:\NReal Horror Stories #49"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.87,0:14:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna watch the first three,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.70,0:14:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"IT COULD HAPPEN TO YOU:\NReal Horror Stories #49"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.70,0:14:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,then the last two after Sota gets home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.04,0:14:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,then the last two after Sota gets home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.29,0:14:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We're watching {\i1}five{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.08,0:15:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, Yoshikawa-san was right.\NYou're double-jointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.58,0:15:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.45,0:15:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Your finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.75,0:15:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.75,0:15:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Dang, Yuki, your hands are tiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.25,0:15:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what're you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.58,0:15:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't it make your heart skip a beat\Nwhen someone grabs your hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.04,0:15:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.00,0:15:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at Yuki's hands! They're so tiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.33,0:15:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, but your hands are small\Ncompared to us guys, Hori.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.58,0:15:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not comparing them to guys' hands right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.12,0:15:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab my hand and you're a dead man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.20,0:15:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear that, Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.45,0:15:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I could {\i1}die {\i0}if I touch Hori!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.29,0:15:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Ishikawa-kun! My hand's open!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.16,0:15:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.16,0:15:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, your finger's double-jointed!\NIs it just your index finger?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.79,0:15:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's always been like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.83,0:15:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you break it or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.41,0:15:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope, just born that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.62,0:15:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how the joint works.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.08,0:16:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No idea. I'd have to get an x-ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.29,0:16:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Your hands are so pale, Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.75,0:16:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a writer's callus, Hori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.83,0:16:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.25,0:16:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so weird how your hands\Nare bigger than mine, Miyamura!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.00,0:16:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Isn't that normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.66,0:16:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I totally thought they were smaller.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.29,0:16:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I, I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.70,0:16:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.83,0:16:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Your hands! I love your hands,\Nthey're--they're nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.54,0:16:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,My hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.37,0:16:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! I was just thinking, "Man, I love 'em!"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.20,0:16:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks. And I hold my pencil right,\Nso I don't have a callus like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.00,0:16:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey! No fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.16,0:16:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.29,0:16:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I love yours, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.75,0:16:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.00,0:16:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.83,0:16:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I heard you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.33,0:16:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.87,0:17:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.50,0:17:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.75,0:17:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sota! Did you wash your hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.62,0:17:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.20,0:17:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What're you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.00,0:17:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san put the DVDs back in\Nthe wrong cases, so I'm fixing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.54,0:17:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, time for dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.20,0:17:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wash your hands, first!\NYou're eating with us, right, Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.54,0:17:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, if that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.83,0:17:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, then you and Sota\Nneed to go wash your hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.41,0:17:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it. Let's go, Sota.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.50,0:17:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.83,0:17:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So I was just talking to her,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.75,0:17:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,and she said she's "never\Nletting me have Miyamura-kun"!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.25,0:17:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.37,0:17:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I was just joking,\Nbut she got like, actually mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.41,0:17:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's 'cause you take\Nyour jokes {\i1}way {\i0}too far, Remi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.41,0:18:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but still!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.91,0:18:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san was sooo scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.91,0:18:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning, Miyamura!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.12,0:18:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.04,0:18:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! What happened to your face?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.08,0:18:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I got into a fight and got hit in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.00,0:18:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You got into a fight? With who?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.00,0:18:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishikawa-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.12,0:18:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,With Toru?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.25,0:18:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, sure, he's a big dummy dum-dum,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.91,0:18:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,but I never thought he'd\Nget violent with a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.50,0:18:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Uhh, Hori-san, actually--
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.16,0:18:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope, I don't want to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.75,0:18:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I know {\i1}just {\i0}the kind\Nof guy he is now, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.29,0:18:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning, Ishikawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.75,0:18:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.16,0:18:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Toru!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.75,0:18:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, mornin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.12,0:18:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You got into a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.33,0:18:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.54,0:18:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So you beat the crap out of each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.54,0:19:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not really...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.33,0:19:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I dodged everything 'cept that first punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.37,0:19:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"ashamed"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.37,0:19:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I beat Ishikawa-kun to a pulp...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.70,0:19:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I beat Ishikawa-kun to a pulp...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.04,0:19:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kinda scary, Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.04,0:19:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why were you fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.41,0:19:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's none of your business, Hori.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.33,0:19:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine. I still can't believe\Nyou two got into an actual fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.54,0:19:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Toru, who won? You or him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.12,0:19:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that look for?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.20,0:19:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.66,0:19:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure I lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.75,0:19:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I know it's not happening, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.54,0:19:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.45,0:19:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, dude, {\i1}listen{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.08,0:19:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm listening! I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.75,0:19:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori's in love with you, Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.50,0:19:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You mentioned that before,\Nbut I still think you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.20,0:19:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just imagining things--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.83,0:19:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.45,0:20:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How would you react if I said I wasn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.70,0:20:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to psych me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.12,0:20:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If Hori said, to your face,\Nthat she loves you, what would you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.45,0:20:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you just brush it off like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.87,0:20:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san just sees me as a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.08,0:20:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you keep going back to that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.75,0:20:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if I don't, you'll keep\Nasking me the same question.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.12,0:20:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.50,0:20:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, it's obvious\Nshe doesn't like me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.45,0:20:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to know why you think you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.95,0:20:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well--!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.70,0:20:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I know your own feelings\Nprobably influence your perception,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.41,0:20:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,but you can't assume how\NHori-san feels without asking her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.54,0:20:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.16,0:20:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"WHACK"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.16,0:20:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.79,0:20:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You startled me, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.16,0:20:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.04,0:20:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Moron?! You're insulting me now?\NWhat gives, Ishikawa-kun?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.08,0:20:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna listen otherwise!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.70,0:20:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,--The hell does that mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.37,0:20:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,--It means--\N--The hell does that mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.08,0:20:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.29,0:20:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.41,0:21:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, your eyes are scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.08,0:21:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura! Time out, time out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.04,0:21:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It... It was self-defense!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.20,0:21:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You beat the shit out of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.83,0:21:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That was uncalled for {\i1}and{\i0}\Nhas nothing to do with Hori!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.20,0:21:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It was just 'cause I startled you, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.45,0:21:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I was also kind of pissed at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.91,0:21:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not supposed to admit that!\NYou're freakin' me out, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.45,0:21:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I pushed Miyamura too far. It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.45,0:21:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.41,0:21:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, go apologize to him and make up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.29,0:21:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, Miyamura said it was all his fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.25,0:21:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what Toru said.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.87,0:21:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,First they beat each other up,\Nnow they both take the blame?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.87,0:21:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,They're so weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.75,0:21:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.70,0:21:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, what were they even fighting about?
